      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "[Attached slip]. The editors' mark that a paper slip was pasted onto the manuscript here, together with the hooked rule showing how far it reaches: the rule runs from the note column on the right across to the 小物成不定納 column on the left, so the whole 正租 and 雜税 tax block on this page comes from the slip rather than from the body of the survey return."
